From fa29fef3034746a1275d3a91641828f82e5481d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:29:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] alibabacloud: attach existing data disks to the PodVM

Attach the requested disks as retained data disks after the new PodVM
reaches Running, then wait for each accepted attachment to complete.
Let ECS validate disk compatibility and report API failures to the
existing cleanup path without an additional AttachDisk retry loop.

Signed-off-by: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
 src/cloud-providers/alibabacloud/provider.go     |   6 +
 src/cloud-providers/alibabacloud/volumes.go      | 120 ++++++++++++++++
 src/cloud-providers/alibabacloud/volumes_test.go | 172 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 298 insertions(+)

